6.1.5.3 SetOpSelectFormat
Function Usage
If you need to infer the dtpye and format supported by the operator inputs and
outputs, you can implement an inference callback function and register it by
calling this API. In addition, set 6.1.6.4 DynamicFormatFlag to true, so that the
inference function can be automatically called to set dtype and format during
operator fusion. During operator prototype registration, dtype and format setting
is not required.
Note that if dtype and format have been registered in the operator prototype, the
registered dtype and format are used, even if the inference function is registered.
Prototype
OpAICoreDef &SetOpSelectFormat(optiling::OP_CHECK_FUNC func);
